step	34	-	Quick guide step 34
line	<str>Talk to Gertrude.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Phingspet or Grimesquit in the Varrock Sewers.</str>
line	
line	<str>Catch 8 rats by having your cat chase nearby rats.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the sisters again.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Jimmy Dazzler in the house west of the Ardougne pub.</str>
line	
line	<str>Read the directions to arrive at the mansion.</str>
line	
line	<str>The garden</str>
line	
line	<str>Upstairs</str>
line	
line	<str>Downstairs</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb back down the trellis to return to Ardougne OR use any teleport. (Your character will say "Good job puss, I think that just about wraps things up here." once you have caught all the rats.)</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Jimmy Dazzler.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Hooknosed Jack in South-east Varrock near the Varrock rat pits manhole. He will make you the rat poison.</str>
line	
line	<str>Run south to the abandoned building and climb up the ladder.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use your rat poison on your cheeses and use them on the 4 rat holes.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Hooknosed Jack.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the Apothecary south-west of Varrock Square. [ if Dragon Slayer II or A Tail of Two Cats is completed, or if One Small Favour is started but not yet completed.]</str>
line	
line	<str>Return and talk to Hooknosed Jack.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head back to the top of the abandoned building.</str>
line	
line	<str>Pick-up, and then use your cat on the corner hole in the wall.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use fish on the hole in the wall (not on your cat) to heal your cat as it fights.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Hooknosed Jack.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head to Keldagrim (trapdoor in north-western part of Grand Exchange, or minigame teleport to Blast Furnace.)</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Smokin' Joe east of the Keldagrim mining shop in east Keldagrim.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use weeds on a pot and light it with your tinderbox.</str>
line	
line	<str>Drop your cat or kitten.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the smouldering pot on the rat hole just east of Smokin' Joe. (Use the Call follower button or relog if your cat disappears)</str>
line	
line	<str>Try it again and accept your cat's help (don't forget to wear the catspeak amulet).</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Smokin' Joe.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head to Port Sarim</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb down the nearby manhole to enter the rat pits</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Felkrash in the east room.</str>
line	
line	<str>Exit the rat pits and talk to The Face.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head to Ali (or Badir) the Snake Charmer in Pollnivneach (just south of the pub).</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Put a coin in his pot and talk to him. must ask about charming</col>
